        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 125.7,
          "end": 128.13,
          "en": "Primarily, we have relational databases",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 128.13,
          "end": 130.89,
          "en": "and then we have a NoSQL databases.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 130.89,
          "end": 132.03,
          "en": "Now in the relational database,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 132.03,
          "end": 133.44,
          "en": "we normally follow tables, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 133.44,
          "end": 135.96,
          "en": "So in one database, you'll be having multiple tables.",
