          "id": 77,
          "start": 154.02,
          "end": 156.03,
          "en": "you store them a document format",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 156.03,
          "end": 157.8,
          "en": "or maybe table in some framework.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 157.8,
          "end": 159.69,
          "en": "Example in Cassandra, we do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 159.69,
          "end": 162.6,
          "en": "But the idea is we can directly store data",
